<div class="u-accordion">
  <details name="shop-faq" open>
    <summary>How long does a ring resize take?</summary>
    <p>Most resizes are ready in three to five days. We'll give you a due date when you drop the ring off, and text you when it's ready.</p>
  </details>
  <details name="shop-faq">
    <summary>Can you change a watch battery while I wait?</summary>
    <p>Yes, for most watches. It takes about 15 minutes and costs $25.00. Water-resistant watches need a pressure test, so we keep those overnight.</p>
  </details>
  <details name="shop-faq">
    <summary>What if I can't pick up on the due date?</summary>
    <p>We hold finished jobs for 90 days. Come by any time we're open, Tuesday to Saturday, 10am to 7pm.</p>
  </details>
</div>
